{"id":"en_unlocking-hearts-unlocking-fortune","title":"Unlocking Hearts, Unlocking Fortune","titleEn":"Unlocking Hearts, Unlocking Fortune","description":"Zhang Chi has always been a doormat. From being picked on in kindergarten to taking a beating while protecting a crush who then chose his tormentor, and later getting cheated by a girlfriend, his life has been one long string of humiliations. Just when he has nothing left, a system awakens inside him. Its rules are simple: whenever he assists attractive women in unlocking something, he receives cash and their affection. Reach one hundred such unlocks, and a major reward is waiting.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/unlocking-hearts-unlocking-fortune/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/unlocking-hearts-unlocking-fortune/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Serendipity","The Comeback","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cs5tq/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_unlocking-hearts-unlocking-fortune_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cs5tq/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_unlocking-hearts-unlocking-fortune_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cs5tq/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_unlocking-hearts-unlocking-fortune_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cs5tq/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_unlocking-hearts-unlocking-fortune_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"ht